  "text": {
    "status": "additional",
    "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Mapping from encounter type value sets to HL7 V3 ActCode (<code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode</code>) encounter class codes. Each mapping applies to all the codes in the source value set.</p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><th>Source Value Set</th><th>Equivalence</th><th>Target Encounter Class</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.117.1.7.1.292\">Emergency Department Visit</a></td><td>wider</td><td><code>EMER</code> (emergency)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.666.5.307\">Encounter Inpatient</a></td><td>wider</td><td><code>IMP</code> (inpatient encounter)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1029.206\">Intensive Care Unit</a></td><td>wider</td><td><code>ACUTE</code> (inpatient acute)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1111.143\">Observation Services</a></td><td>wider</td><td><code>OBSENC</code> (observation encounter)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1110.38\">Outpatient Surgery Service</a></td><td>wider</td><td><code>AMB</code> (ambulatory)</td></tr></table></div>"
