  "description": "Example of a concept map used to share a mapping from the encounter type value sets used in quality measures to the HL7 V3 ActCode encounter class codes. Each mapping applies to all the codes in the given encounter type value set, identified using the R5 `ConceptMap.group.element.valueSet` element (represented in R4 using the cross-version extension). The value sets are those declared in the [CQMCommon](https://github.com/cqframework/dqm-content-cms-2026/blob/main/input/cql/CQMCommon.cql) library.",
  "jurisdiction": [
    {
      "coding": [
